WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:31.870
Bakura retrieved the stolen God Cards for me.

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:37.810
He says the world of my lost memories is the ultimate Shadow Game.

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:41.980
Bakura, I don't know what you're planning.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.780
But I accept your challenge!

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:48.090
I'm finally arriving in Egypt.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:52.390
The door to my memories will now open.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:58.400
The Door of Memories Opens

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.810
We finally arrived.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.840
Egypt really is far.

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:10.760
What do we do now?

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.240
Sorry.  Hold on a sec!

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.810
C'mon, Anzu!

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.640
Shop for souvenirs later!

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.660
Hmm...  There it is!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.650
I'll buy it!

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.950
We’re not here as tourists!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.330
Sorry.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.670
Yugi!  Everyone!

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.970
Ishizu!  Marik!

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.390
How’ve you been?

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:39.040
Good.  And you're full of energy.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:42.980
So much energy that we came to Egypt!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.860
We’ve been waiting for you.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:52.020
Yugi-  I mean, the nameless Pharaoh.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:56.030
We’ll take you to the stone tablet.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.320
Thank you.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.230
It’s huge!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.450
So that's a real pyramid!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.560
Look!  A sphinx!

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:11.800
Wow!  Its nose is really broken!

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:23.590
Inside is the tablet that will open the door to my memories.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.990
This is as far as we go.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:29.590
When you present the three cards to the tablet...

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:32.530
...the door to your lost memories will open.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:37.240
Nameless Pharaoh, forge your own path.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.590
Right.  I'm going.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:52.410
Our 3,000-year duty as Tombkeepers is now complete.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.280
Yes.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:57.000
Every soul has a place to return to.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.210
The Pharaoh has now started that journey.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:08.830
The door to the nameless Pharaoh’s lost memories will finally open.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.710
Here it is.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.640
The tablet of memories…

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.010
Yugi…

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:35.480
I always call him Yugi, but the person inside Yugi is a different individual.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:40.020
But I don’t know his real name.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.670
Yugi.

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.070
Take this.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.200
What is it?

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.400
It’s a cartouche.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.970
The names of ancient Pharaohs were inscribed into them.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.400
But there’s no name in this one.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:05:01.790
When you regain your memories and remember your name, engrave it into that.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.350
Then you'll never forget again.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.730
The Pharaoh's name has been shaved off the tablet.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:14.890
I just want to know your real name.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.840
That’s a good idea!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.570
If you carve your name into that, you’ll never forget it!

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.570
You're right.  Thank you, Anzu.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.010
I’ll take good care of it.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:36.040
I've made it here again with three God Cards in hand.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.420
What will happen next?

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:43.420
The answer is before my eyes.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.080
Here I go.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:06:02.310
My other self that's inside the Millennium Puzzle has struck the gong to start the game.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:35.840
This is the door to my lost memories!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.480
The time has arrived!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.980
What was that?

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:18.920
It felt like a powerful light struck me.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:20.730
Yugi!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:21.830
Yugi?

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.900
Are you okay?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.730
He’s gone.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.190
Who’s gone?

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:35.440
My other self is no longer inside the Puzzle or my soul.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:39.910
My other self…

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.210
Vessel of the Pharaoh...

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:46.960
The Pharaoh went to the world of his memories.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:47.910
Who's there!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.190
You're Shadi!

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:56.390
You're the guy from the blimp!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.830
You saved Otogi and me.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.290
What’s he doing here?

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.270
Wait.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.440
He has Millennium Items too.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:47.100
Pharaoh!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.150
What's this?

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:54.350
Pharaoh, the people are waiting to hear from you.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:55.610
Speak to them.

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.670
I’m... the Pharaoh...

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.900
Pharaoh!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:17.240
The people are also anxiously waiting for the new Pharaoh in the courtyard.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.480
Pharaoh, take the throne.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.360
This is the world of my memories...

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:44.240
Everyone, rise!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.400
The new Pharaoh is here!

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:52.900
Kaiba?  Ishizu?

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.560
Grandpa?

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:55.970
G-Grandpa?

00:09:57.010 --> 00:10:00.410
Shimon, perhaps the Pharaoh is tired.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.410
N-No, I’m fine.  Carry on.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.920
Continue the festival!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.300
A celebration so lavish that it will blow away the Pharaoh's troubles!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.270
What’s going on?

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.220
Those are Millennium Items…  But who are they?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.370
You know who.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:43.350
They’re the six priests chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:47.590
The six priests chosen by the Millennium Items?

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.900
Keep walking!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.600
He fainted again.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.340
Just our luck.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.780
We're missing the party at the palace.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:30.540
Because this man was graverobbing during the new Pharaoh's coronation.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:32.900
What's that?

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:46.950
Dammit.  This is how my game begins?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:51.300
But this is clearly the world of his memories.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:19.860
I see.  You’ve come to greet me.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:27.300
I’m starting to remember details from 3,000 years ago.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:32.240
But he’s a Pharaoh, while I’m a mere bandit.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:36.210
I don't like our status gap.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.240
An advisor who looks like Grandpa…

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.360
Ishizu…

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:01.490
Grandpa finding the Millennium Puzzle…

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.060
Ishizu being a Tombkeeper...

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:07.480
Maybe it wasn't just coincidence.  And...

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:15.290
He's definitely the priest next to me on the tablet of memories.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:30.120
Mahad!

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:37.990
Capture that scoundrel!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.980
How dare you try to assassinate the Pharaoh!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:57.380
But this is a time of celebration, so just throw him in prison!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:58.420
Wait.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:06.260
This is the perfect opportunity for the new Pharaoh to witness our powers.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:09.530
Do you agree, Aknadin and Shimon?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.360
That’s a fine idea!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:16.400
Let us judge his sins before the Pharaoh.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.080
We'll now hold a public trial!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.120
Public trial?

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:29.180
Egypt has recently become a powerful country.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:34.120
But there are those who are envious of our prosperity.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.490
But don't worry, Pharaoh.

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:41.060
As long as we six priests are with you, no one will lay a finger on you.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:46.490
The seven Millennium Items will judge your sins!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.200
The Millennium Items will judge him?

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.480
Priest Shada!

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:58.080
With the power of the Millennium Key, I shall see into his heart!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:10.120
I see an evil monster inside his heart.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:20.060
I, Priest Aknadin, will use the Millennium Eye to identity the monster!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.360
What’s that?

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:33.120
This is your first time seeing a Ka removed from a criminal.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:38.090
Anger and hatred gave birth to that Ka inside his heart.

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.510
Ka?

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:47.450
In order to gain power, evil Ka control their hosts to commit crimes...

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:50.400
...so that their anger and hatred grow.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:57.560
Watch as the priests, chosen by the seven sacred items, seal the Ka in that tablet.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.000
Tablet?

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:08.710
Priest Seto, use your Millennium Rod to seal the Ka into the tablet!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.820
A Ka this weak is barely entertaining.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:20.600
Evil Ka, enter the sacred tablet!

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:39.310
This is the true power of the Millennium Items.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.350
Shadi…

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:52.360
Vessel of the Pharaoh, his soul is no longer inside you.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:55.360
The Pharaoh went to the world of memories.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.060
World of memories?

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:03.240
The world of memories is made from the Pharaoh's experiences 3,000 years ago.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:07.170
Does that mean he's forgotten about us?

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:13.440
No.  Even in the world of memories, he retains his current memories.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:18.010
But the Pharaoh will relive his destiny once again.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:23.290
And he'll learn why his soul was sealed inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:29.300
So the other Yugi's soul will be sealed inside the Millennium Puzzle again?

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:34.760
So the other Yugi can't come back-

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:38.970
Y-You're...

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.540
My flesh is long gone.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.970
We’re talking to a ghost?

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:53.080
Bakura destroyed my body.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.520
Bakura?

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.750
Bakura?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:18:00.840
The spirit inside Bakura is a collection of evil.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:04.700
And even now threatens the nameless Pharaoh.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:12.980
The Millennium Items have informed me that in order to learn the truth...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.580
...the nameless Pharaoh went to the world of memories with Yami Bakura.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.240
With Yami Bakura?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.410
And there, their ultimate Shadow Game will begin.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.770
What?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:28.350
I never heard of this!  Yugi?

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.120
I didn’t know either.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.360
Why wouldn't he tell us?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:39.730
The other Yugi didn’t want to worry us.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:44.800
Shadi, can I do something to help my other self?

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:47.160
I know you know something.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:49.230
That’s why you came here.

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:54.680
Please tell me.  I want to help my other self.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:03.120
There is a way you can enter the world of the Pharaoh’s memories.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.550
How?

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:08.760
The Pharaoh’s labyrinth of the heart inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:11.500
Find the true door.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.840
Labyrinth of the heart?

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:20.370
Beyond that door is the world of the Pharaoh’s memories.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:27.240
Don't I look more like a king now?

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:30.980
I’ll take you to see Yugi.

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:33.240
I’m sure he’ll be overjoyed.

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:38.120
Let's go say hi to the Pharaoh!

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.750
Good work, Seto.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:46.000
But it must've been boring for the Pharaoh.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:49.420
Shall we also tear him limb from limb?

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:52.360
The evil inside him is gone.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:56.920
He may be a criminal, but priests must show mercy.

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:58.800
Take him away!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:04.810
Mahad, your security force is in charge of protecting this city.

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:09.200
There have been many grave robberies recently.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.180
How do you account for these failures?

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.090
Forgive me.

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:22.720
Recently, the Millennium Ring has been behaving chaotically.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:26.050
So I can't detect the criminals' evil intentions.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:31.470
Pharaoh, may I increase the security force to protect the city?

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:33.420
S-Sure.  Please do.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:38.350
Store that Ka tablet in the tablet shrine!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.190
There's so much I don't understand.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:48.220
Is this really the ultimate Shadow Game Bakura spoke of?

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.220
Don't worry, Pharaoh.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:56.190
I've taken the responsibility of building your tomb.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.900
M-My tomb?

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:03.540
No bandit will be able to evade the traps in your tomb.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:07.230
I promise that you'll sleep peacefully after you die.

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:10.850
I see…

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:14.260
Continue the festival!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.420
Wait!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.380
What is it, Isis?

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:22.720
My Millennium Necklace senses a disturbing future.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.120
What?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.600
A disturbing future?

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:29.800
An evil shadow is approching the palace.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.360
One with incredible power.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:41.120
Yugi, let's begin the ultimate Shadow Game!

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:13.760
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:29.480
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:35.320
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:43.890
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:49.530
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:58.000
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:03.810
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:11.950
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:15.210
In a duel

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:30.250
The other Yugi went to the world of lost memories.

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:35.050
He's experiencing events from 3,000 years ago again.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.520
But he didn't tell us that Yami Bakura went with him!

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:44.250
In the world of memories, his battle against Bakura begins.

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:47.520
Just wait!  We're coming!

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:51.510
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Meet Bandit King Bakura!

00:23:51.510 --> 00:23:53.000
Stay tuned!
